Comic Vine Scraper for .NET

This project is a C# port of Comic Vine Scraper by Cory Banack
(https://github.com/cbanack/comic-vine-scraper), version 1.0.102,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The port rewrites the original IronPython source in C#. The translation
files and images in this repository come from the original project.
